-    reduction satisfies |fp32(P)-P| <= gamma*S with gamma=K*u/(1-K*u) and
-    u=2^-24.  Convert both double bounds to FP32 and widen one FP32 ulp
-    outward before XPU BF16 RNU materialization.  The bias add remains RNE.
